  "narrative": {
    "intro": "This ranking shows the top small-business contractors by contract obligations in FY2026 to date, with total obligations of $22.1B. ATLANTIC DIVING SUPPLY, INC. leads the list with obligations of $3B. CSI AVIATION, INC follows with $1.1B. W S DARLEY & CO recorded $934M, AMERICAN CENTRIFUGE OPERATING, LLC recorded $916M, and GENERAL MATTER, INC. recorded $900M. MINBURN TECHNOLOGY GROUP, LLC recorded $763M, THUNDERCAT TECHNOLOGY, LLC recorded $759M, FOUR POINTS TECHNOLOGY, L.L.C. recorded $733M, V3GATE, LLC recorded $672M, and COCHRANE USA INC recorded $641M. The page is a ranking of contract obligations and reflects fiscal year to date totals, so current-year totals are partial. Readers should treat the listed figures as obligations for the fiscal year to date rather than full-year totals. The list is restricted to firms identified as small businesses and ranks them by the dollar amount of obligations received in FY2026 to date. Use the list to identify which small businesses have the largest obligation totals so far this fiscal year.",
