        "body": "ATLANTIC DIVING SUPPLY, INC. is the top small-business contractor with obligations of $3B. CSI AVIATION, INC follows with obligations of $1.1B. W S DARLEY & CO, AMERICAN CENTRIFUGE OPERATING, LLC, and GENERAL MATTER, INC. round out the next tier with obligations of $934M, $916M, and $900M respectively."
      },
